{{Navbar-Global Gas Infrastructure Tracker}}

'''MountainWest Gas Pipeline''' is an operating gas pipeline in Utah, Wyoming, and Colorado, United States.<ref name=":1">{{Cite web|url=https://www.mwpipe.com/Home/MWP#pagetitle|title=Home - MountainWest Pipeline (MWP)|website=www.mwpipe.com|access-date=2025-09-19}}</ref>
==Location==

The pipeline runs through northeastern Utah, southern Wyoming, and northwestern Colorado.<ref name=":1" />
==Project Details==

=== Main Line ===
*'''Owner: '''Williams<ref name=":2">{{Cite news|url=https://www.williams.com/pipeline/mountainwest/|title=MountainWest {{!}} Williams Companies|work=Williams Companies|access-date=2025-09-19|language=en-US}}</ref>
*'''Capacity: '''2,600 MMcf/d<ref name=":2" />
*'''Length: '''1,868 mi<ref name=":2" />
*'''Status: '''Operating<ref name=":1" />

=== Overthrust Gas Pipeline ===
*'''Owner: '''Williams<ref name=":2" />
*'''Capacity: '''2,800 MMcf/d<ref name=":2" />
*'''Length: '''261 mi<ref name=":2" />
*'''Status: '''Operating<ref name=":1" />

